Mobile courses and segments need larger tables than Windows sized: Android's BuildLevel
(0007e88c) allows 3500 rows, and its catalog holds 133 PC and 43 mobile-only segments.
The track render cache, which Android replaced with cRWorld, covers 24 rows per entry.
Every port build gets the larger tables; the row limit follows the profile, and both
originals only report a track that is too long.

